cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these tutorials, please cite them as below. Please also cite the
  datasets, papers and software they describe; see references.bib.
title: "RodentStudio model tutorials: from open data to an offline Mac app"
abstract: >-
  Bilingual (English/Chinese) tutorials documenting the provenance, training,
  evaluation, Core ML export and app integration of the pose and detection
  models bundled with RodentStudio, with a reference list, licence summary and
  BibTeX for every dataset, paper and software package involved.
authors:
  - family-names: Shi
    given-names: Ziqing
version: 0.1.0
url: "https://seesaw-earth.github.io/RodentFlow/tutorials/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/seesaw-earth/RodentStudio-Tutorials"
keywords:
  - pose estimation
  - mouse behavior
  - YOLO
  - Core ML
  - DeepLabCut
  - data provenance
